{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a simulation management game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell lottery tickets and scratch-off cards to cat customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase lottery tickets, and a daily draw after each day will determine the corresponding prizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scratch off tickets to immediately receive corresponding rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search through customers' leftover scratch-offs to collect overlooked prizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invest in stocks, place bets on prediction games\u2014higher risks, greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Redecorate your shop, hire staff to automate operations, and work hard to attract more cat customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade with mysterious figures for lottery draw numbers to boost your winning odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s more to this world than meets the eye.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3438950?t=1743926043","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3438950?t=1743926043","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438950/7b6d51a2856dfc9b342bca6259d6140f76b048b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743926043","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3438950/7b6d51a2856dfc9b342bca6259d6140f76b048b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743926043","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a simulation management game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell lottery tickets and scratch-off cards to cat customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase lottery tickets, and a daily draw after each day will determine the corresponding prizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scratch off tickets to immediate